  "id": "type-2-diabetes",
  "term": "Type 2 diabetes",
  "definition": "Type 2 diabetes is a metabolic disease that is linked with small- and large-blood-vessel complications and, in this source, with mildly restricted breathing capacity. The review describes it as being associated with lower lung function measures even without a separate lung disorder, possibly because diabetes-related changes in the lung’s tiny blood vessels and air sacs can reduce oxygen uptake.",
